stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: assert len(xs) == len(ys)
    q_validate --> q_init: r = PolynomialCoeff([0])
    q_init --> q_iter_i: for i in range(len(xs))
    q_iter_i --> q_init_summand: has next i
    q_iter_i --> q_return: no more i
    q_init_summand --> q_iter_j: summand = PolynomialCoeff([ys[i]])
    q_iter_j --> q_check_j: for j in range(len(ys))
    q_check_j --> q_skip: j == i
    q_check_j --> q_weight: j != i
    q_skip --> q_iter_j: continue
    q_weight --> q_multiply: weight = (xs[i] - xs[j]).inverse()
    q_multiply --> q_iter_j: summand = multiply(summand, [-w*xs[j], w])
    q_iter_i --> q_return: done iterating
    q_return --> [*]: return r
    note right of q_iter_j: inner loop builds Lagrange basis
